{
  "id": 1412,
  "description": "# Command Guild. 🛡️ \n\nWelcome to Command Guild.\n\n# Guild Goal 🏆\n**Our goal is to find active members and become stronger together with them.**\n\n# Guild Info 🧭\n🤝 **In Command Guild, everyone is equal. ✨ Everyone is treated with respect and fairness.**\n\n# Guild Rules  ⚖️\n**Follow the rules of idlemmo.**\n**Rule of 7 days.**\n**The 7 days rule is you will be removed from guild after 7 days if you don&#039;t give any information about you won&#039;t be able to play**\n\n# What Are the Benefits of Command Guild? 🎯\n\n**Currently, there are not many benefits.**⚠️\n**But we are actively improving and growing.**📈\n\n# Current Requirements. 📦\n\n**Must be active.** 💡\n**No obligation to contribute to challenges/stockpile.**📌\n\n**Just contribute items you don’t need.**✔️\n**Help the guild grow at your own pace.**✔️\n**No level requirements too!**✔️\n\n# During Event Time. 🎉 \n\n**You don’t need to do anything for the guild.** 🕒\n\n**Because:**\n\n**Event rewards are limited-time. We want you to fully focus on your own progress.**🎁\n\n**Future Benefits.**🔮\n\n**We are planning:**🚧\n\n**Daily Raids.**⚔️\n**Guild Hall.**🏰\n\n **Once we build guild hall, we will provide even more benefits to all members.**✨ \n\n# Join Command Guild and grow together! 🔥 \n\n**Discord** https://discord.gg/uNMBAZfjrr",
